docs {
  # Admin - Get Report Statistics

  **Method:** `GET`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/admin/reports/stats`
  **Auth:** Required (Admin Access Token)

  ## Description
  Returns high-level aggregated moderation metrics for the admin dashboard, including breakdown of report counts across all statuses.

  ## Request

  ### Headers
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |

  ## Response
  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "total_reports": 42,
      "by_status": {
        "PENDING": 12,
        "UNDER_REVIEW": 5,
        "RESOLVED": 20,
        "REJECTED": 3,
        "DISMISSED": 2
      }
    }
  }
  ```
}
